---
import Section from '@csss-site-events/ui/components/Section.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site.data';
---

<Section id="about" title="What's a FROSH?">
  <strong>FROSH Week</strong> is a series of events run by the Computing Science Student Society at Simon
  Fraser University in collaboration with the School of Computing Science.
  <br />
  <br />
  FROSH Week occurs during the fall semester to welcome <strong>
    hundreds of new undergraduate students
  </strong> into the School of Computing Science with the help of 80+ volunteers. Starting a degree is
  a pivotal moment in a student's academic journey, and Frosh Week helps forge lasting memories and strong
  friendships.
  <br />
  <br />
  {siteConfig.eventName} continues this tradition, running from <strong
    >{siteConfig.startDate}th</strong
  > to <strong>{siteConfig.endDate}th</strong>.
</Section>
